  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:09.430" end="00:14.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(X-O, X-O)</p>
      <p begin="00:14.360" end="00:19.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Kiss me, don't say no)</p>
      <p begin="00:19.300" end="00:24.270" ttm:agent="v1">X-O-O-O-O-O-O, X-O-O-O-O-O-O</p>
      <p begin="00:24.270" end="00:29.280" ttm:agent="v1">Kiss me-e-e-e-e-e, don't say no-o-o-o-o-o</p>
      <p begin="00:29.280" end="00:32.310" ttm:agent="v1">X-O, yeah, huh</p>
      <p begin="00:32.310" end="00:34.870" ttm:agent="v1">Ojik neoman jul su inneun heoragui mal</p>
      <p begin="00:34.870" end="00:40.000" ttm:agent="v1">Haedo daldo ttada jul su isseo, malhae heoragui geu mal</p>
      <p begin="00:40.000" end="00:48.000" ttm:agent="v1">Neoui X-O, naui guwon, please, babe, say yes</p>
      <p begin="00:48.650" end="00:53.740" ttm:agent="v1">Hwanghoni naeril ttae, ne modeun kkumeul iruoejulge</p>
      <p begin="00:53.740" end="00:58.550" ttm:agent="v1">Please, say my name, na neoui jini ga doeeojulge</p>
      <p begin="00:58.550" end="01:03.870" ttm:agent="v1">So just say O, babe, nal umjigineun dan hana yeolsoe, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:03.870" end="01:08.870" ttm:agent="v1">Nareul sayonghae, nae ujui yuilhan sin geudae</p>
      <p begin="01:08.870" end="01:13.840" ttm:agent="v1">X-O, X-O</p>
      <p begin="01:13.840" end="01:18.770" ttm:agent="v1">Kiss me, don't say no</p>
      <p begin="01:18.770" end="01:23.670" ttm:agent="v1">X-O-O-O-O-O-O, X-O-O-O-O-O-O</p>
      <p begin="01:23.670" end="01:28.680" ttm:agent="v1">Kiss me-e-e-e-e-e, don't say no-o-o-o-o-o</p>
      <p begin="01:28.680" end="01:33.530" ttm:agent="v1">X-O-O-O-O-O-O, X-O-O-O-O-O-O</p>
      <p begin="01:33.530" end="01:38.630" ttm:agent="v1">Kiss me-e-e-e-e-e, just say O-O-O-O-O-O</p>
      <p begin="01:38.630" end="01:40.130" ttm:agent="v1">X-O, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:40.080" end="01:42.460" ttm:agent="v1">Can I kiss you? Can I hug you?</p>
      <p begin="01:42.460" end="01:44.920" ttm:agent="v1">Neoege gamsahae, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:44.920" end="01:47.470" ttm:agent="v1">Would you kiss me? Would you hug me?</p>
      <p begin="01:47.470" end="01:49.520" ttm:agent="v1">Heorageul guhalge, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:49.520" end="01:54.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">One and (one and) only (only) naui (naui) yeosin (yeosin)</p>
      <p begin="01:54.160" end="01:57.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">For you (for you), I will</p>
      <p begin="01:57.800" end="02:02.770" ttm:agent="v1">So just say O, babe, jeo dareul hyanghae naraga bollae?</p>
      <p begin="02:02.770" end="02:07.630" ttm:agent="v1">So just say O, babe, deo meotjin chawajibi piryohae?</p>
      <p begin="02:07.630" end="02:13.260" ttm:agent="v1">So just say O, babe, nal umjigineun dan hana yeolsoe, yeah</p>
      <p begin="02:13.260" end="02:18.260" ttm:agent="v1">Nareul sayonghae, ne modeun kkumi iruojige</p>
      <p begin="02:18.260" end="02:23.010" ttm:agent="v1">X-O, X-O</p>
      <p begin="02:23.010" end="02:27.990" ttm:agent="v1">Kiss me, don't say no</p>
      <p begin="02:27.990" end="02:32.830" ttm:agent="v1">X-O-O-O-O-O-O, X-O-O-O-O-O-O</p>
      <p begin="02:32.830" end="02:37.920" ttm:agent="v1">Kiss me-e-e-e-e-e, don't say no-o-o-o-o-o</p>
      <p begin="02:37.920" end="02:42.970" ttm:agent="v1">X-O-O-O-O-O-O, X-O-O-O-O-O-O</p>
      <p begin="02:42.970" end="02:47.220" ttm:agent="v1">Kiss me-e-e-e-e-e, just say O-O-O-O-O-O</p>
